# 60. REDIS/CELERY

If Redis/Celery already exists in the project:

Use them only where justified.

Potential future use:

```text
notifications
attendance reminders
missed checkout alerts
daily attendance processing
scheduled reports
```

Do not move core attendance calculations to asynchronous jobs if the user needs an immediate authoritative check-in/check-out response.

