Phase 4 is complete only when:

## Backend

* Attendance APIs working
* Check-in working
* Check-out working
* Duplicate protection working
* Shift management working
* Employee shift assignment working
* Work-week handling working
* Holiday foundation working
* Attendance calculation working
* Late calculation working
* Early-exit calculation working
* Break calculation working
* Overnight shift working
* Regularization foundation working
* RBAC working
* Tenant isolation working
* Audit logging working
* API documentation working

## Database

* Proper relationships
* Foreign keys
* Unique constraints
* Required indexes
* Historical records preserved
* Tenant isolation enforced
* Migrations verified

## Frontend

* Employee attendance dashboard
* Check-in/check-out UI
* Attendance history
* Shift management
* Shift assignment
* Admin attendance dashboard
* Filters
* Pagination
* Loading states
* Error states
* Responsive UI

## Testing

All important:

* unit tests
* API tests
* integration tests
* security tests
* tenant isolation tests
* RBAC tests
* timezone tests
* concurrency tests
* edge-case tests

must pass.

